ODC8502 [*] `pylint: disable` comment should be migrated to `# ruff: ignore[method-required-super]`
  --> pylint_disable_comment_standalone.py:14:9
   |
13 |     def unlink(self):
14 |         # pylint: disable=method-required-super
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
15 |         # The pragma is the first line of the body, so it also covers the `def` header,
16 |         # which is where `method-required-super` is reported.
   |
help: Replace with `# ruff: ignore[method-required-super]`
   |
12 |
13 +     # ruff: disable[method-required-super]
14 |     def unlink(self):
   -         # pylint: disable=method-required-super
15 |         # The pragma is the first line of the body, so it also covers the `def` header,
16 |         # which is where `method-required-super` is reported.
17 |         return True
18 +     # ruff: enable[method-required-super]
19 |
   |

