ODC8502 [*] `pylint: disable` comment should be migrated to `# ruff: ignore[invalid-commit]`
  --> pylint_disable_comment_standalone.py:59:1
   |
57 | # line of its own, since Ruff only reads a suppression trailing other text when it is a
58 | # `ruff: ignore`, and `invalid-suppression-comment` would delete a `disable` written there.
59 | # pylint: disable=invalid-commit,some-custom-check
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
60 | def kept_pragma_at_module_level(cr):
61 |     cr.commit()
   |
help: Replace with `# ruff: ignore[invalid-commit]`
